    "industrial_process_notes": "Synthesized via free-radical polymerization of vinylidene fluoride monomer. Major manufacturers include Arkema (Kynar), Solvay (Hylar, Solef), and Kureha (KF). Strong piezoelectric activity in poled thin films was documented in 1969.",
