    "crystal_structure": "Polymorphic: the beta (β) phase has the highest dipolar moment per unit cell and dominates PVDF's piezoelectric/ferroelectric behavior once poled. Four crystal forms are documented: Form I/α (orthorhombic, a=0.858, b=0.491, c=0.256 nm), Form II/β (monoclinic, a=0.496, b=0.964, c=0.462 nm, β≈90°), Form III/γ (orthorhombic, a=0.497, b=0.966, c=0.966 nm), Form IV/δ (orthorhombic, same cell as β).",
